@* A badge that is waiting for something. The spinner inherits the badge's colour and size,
   because it is an icon and the badge already sizes its icons. *@
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
    <Badge Variant="secondary"><Spinner Class="size-3" />Syncing</Badge>
    <Badge Variant="outline"><Spinner Class="size-3" />Queued</Badge>
</div>
